00:01:01.478 --> 00:01:03.397
but that means
you put them back

00:01:03.480 --> 00:01:05.107
where you found them.
Got it?

00:01:05.190 --> 00:01:07.234
Joey, give me a hand.

00:01:08.652 --> 00:01:11.113
Here, grab this tray.
Here.

00:01:12.197 --> 00:01:14.283
-How are you doing, Pacey?
-I'm good, Bess.

00:01:14.366 --> 00:01:15.826
I'm good, thanks.

00:01:16.451 --> 00:01:18.787
Sorry I'm late Mr Douglas.
My car broke d...

00:01:18.871 --> 00:01:19.913
Sorry.

00:01:21.164 --> 00:01:22.207
I'm so sorry.

00:01:23.709 --> 00:01:24.710
Hi.

00:01:24.793 --> 00:01:26.587
Contrary to popular belief,

00:01:26.670 --> 00:01:28.255
I did not come here
to ruin your life

00:01:28.338 --> 00:01:30.549
and I am trying so hard
not to do that.

00:01:34.720 --> 00:01:37.389
I'm sorry...
She has food in her teeth.

00:01:40.392 --> 00:01:41.351
Oh, my God.

00:01:43.520 --> 00:01:45.272
-Oh...
-Great. Just great.

00:01:45.355 --> 00:01:46.899
