00:01:51.028 --> 00:01:52.738
Oh, my God, oh, my God.

00:01:53.280 --> 00:01:54.990
Officer, please,
I am so sorry.

00:01:55.073 --> 00:01:56.450
Promise me I can visit.

00:01:57.117 --> 00:01:58.744
