that man of yours.

00:01:59.953 --> 00:02:01.371
Love you to death,
little sis.

00:02:01.455 --> 00:02:03.290
Love you more,
little brother.

00:02:05.751 --> 00:02:07.544
How do you feel
about my filmmaking?

00:02:07.628 --> 00:02:09.505
-Hi, I'm Jack.
-Can I help you?

00:02:10.380 --> 00:02:12.257
-Andie's brother.
-Who's Andie?

00:02:12.799 --> 00:02:13.550
My sister.

00:02:13.634 --> 00:02:14.968
With what
we've been through

00:02:15.052 --> 00:02:16.720
I'll be damned
if we get back together

00:02:16.803 --> 00:02:19.306
over your sense
of obligation,

00:02:19.389 --> 00:02:20.265
or, worse, pity.

00:02:21.058 --> 00:02:22.100
Screw pity.

00:02:24.937 --> 00:02:26.021
I love you.

00:02:27.689 --> 00:02:28.815
I love you, Jack.

00:02:31.026 --> 00:02:33.320
I love that you're
the bravest person I know...

00:02:35.531 --> 00:02:36.782
