is gonna stand out.

00:02:46.542 --> 00:02:47.876
I wanna stand out with you.

00:02:49.753 --> 00:02:50.879
And your daughter.

00:02:53.966 --> 00:02:55.050
If you'll let me.

00:03:06.311 --> 00:03:08.313
That's the Dudleys
right there.

00:03:08.397 --> 00:03:10.691
Oh, just stop
your punk ass whining.

00:03:11.441 --> 00:03:12.693
School is out today

00:03:12.776 --> 00:03:14.278
It's my one chance
to sleep in,

00:03:14.361 --> 00:03:16.572
catch up on my soaps,
enjoy the storm.

00:03:16.655 --> 00:03:17.865
Hey, dad's orders.

00:03:18.657 --> 00:03:19.491
Evening,

00:03:19.575 --> 00:03:20.826
Mr and Mrs Dudley.

00:03:21.493 --> 00:03:22.870
I was just, uh...

00:03:24.538 --> 00:03:26.081
kissing my boyfriend.

00:03:26.164 --> 00:03:28.041
That's sweet, dear.

00:03:37.718 --> 00:03:38.427
Joey.

00:03:38.510 --> 00:03:39.761
Audrey.

00:03:39.845 --> 00:03:41.805
Can I ask
my favourite roommate

00:03:41.889 --> 00:03:44.266
