-Hair on back. Gross.

00:04:11.460 --> 00:04:12.461
Ah, that's good.

00:04:14.546 --> 00:04:15.923
Too good.

00:04:16.006 --> 00:04:17.049
Actually.

00:04:18.550 --> 00:04:20.177
Might make a bloke
wanna invite a bird

00:04:20.260 --> 00:04:21.678
