for a nightcap.

00:04:24.139 --> 00:04:25.265
What do you say?

00:04:29.269 --> 00:04:30.187
Absolutely.

00:04:37.778 --> 00:04:39.071
Oh, no.

00:04:40.113 --> 00:04:40.864
No, what?

00:04:40.948 --> 00:04:43.033
No. Not interested.

00:04:44.535 --> 00:04:46.036
No, not interested in what?

00:04:46.745 --> 00:04:48.622
Take care of yourself,
Charlie.

00:04:49.581 --> 00:04:50.415
I will.

00:04:56.880 --> 00:04:58.173
Jennifer!

00:06:15.375 --> 00:06:17.586
I'll see you soon,

00:06:17.669 --> 00:06:18.712
child.

00:06:22.883 --> 00:06:24.009
Soon.

00:06:24.510 --> 00:06:26.303
-Hey, there.
-Hi.

00:06:26.386 --> 00:06:27.971
I'm Pacey,
nice to meet you.

00:06:28.055 --> 00:06:29.181
Hi, I'm Dawson.

00:06:29.264 --> 00:06:31.558
You're Dawson.
Dawson, yeah, I know.

00:06:31.642 --> 00:06:33.018
We met before, I'm Jen.

00:06:33.727 --> 00:06:35.187
The granddaughter
from New York.

00:06:35.729 --> 00:06:37.481
You look different.

00:06:38.774 --> 00:06:40.108
