find a place to be?

00:06:47.658 --> 00:06:49.826
I feel like
I never really quite fit.

00:06:51.453 --> 00:06:53.205
Which is why we're us.

00:06:54.873 --> 00:06:55.791
I know.

00:06:57.000 --> 00:07:00.295
From the second that
I stepped out of that cabin

00:07:00.379 --> 00:07:01.505
