00:07:36.832 --> 00:07:38.000
You're my soulmate.

00:07:40.252 --> 00:07:41.253
Hey.

00:07:41.962 --> 00:07:42.963
Thought you could...

00:07:43.046 --> 00:07:44.715
If you come up
before she's on the dock,

00:07:44.798 --> 00:07:45.674
