00:08:11.825 --> 00:08:12.826
Spielberg?

00:08:12.910 --> 00:08:14.328
Get out of town.

00:08:14.411 --> 00:08:16.038
Look at you,
big Hollywood player man.

00:08:16.121 --> 00:08:16.955
Oh, my God!

00:08:17.039 --> 00:08:19.124
What are you gonna say?
What are you gonna wear?

00:08:19.208 --> 00:08:20.334
